/-!
# All packed column-orbit products

Each of the 1407 positive-index steps in the published column orbit has its
packed product checked by the kernel against the unchanged proposed transpose
tables. The first 32 products are supplied by `ProductStart`; the remaining
blocks are checked independently, and `productsCheck_append` combines them.

This discharges precisely `ProductChecks`. The independent `TransposeChecks`
then lets `Cyclicity.columnOrbitRecurrences_of_checks` interpret these products
as the literal column actions. See `source/README.md` for
source provenance and conventions, and `ProductCertificates/source/README.md`
for the bounded build measurements.
-/

public section
namespace Representation.HigmanSims.LargeModels.Restricted1408.Density.Cyclicity.ColumnRecurrences

/-- Every published positive-index column-orbit step has the stated packed product. -/
theorem productChecks : ProductChecks := by
  unfold ProductChecks steps
  simp only [productsCheck_append,
    stepBlock00_check, stepBlock01_check, stepBlock02_check, stepBlock03_check,
    stepBlock04_check, stepBlock05_check, stepBlock06_check, stepBlock07_check,
    stepBlock08_check, stepBlock09_check, stepBlock10_check, stepBlock11_check,
    stepBlock12_check, stepBlock13_check, stepBlock14_check, stepBlock15_check,
    stepBlock16_check, stepBlock17_check, stepBlock18_check, stepBlock19_check,
    stepBlock20_check, stepBlock21_check, stepBlock22_check, stepBlock23_check,
    stepBlock24_check, stepBlock25_check, stepBlock26_check, stepBlock27_check,
    stepBlock28_check, stepBlock29_check, stepBlock30_check, stepBlock31_check,
    stepBlock32_check, stepBlock33_check, stepBlock34_check, stepBlock35_check,
    stepBlock36_check, stepBlock37_check, stepBlock38_check, stepBlock39_check,
    stepBlock40_check, stepBlock41_check, stepBlock42_check, stepBlock43_check, Bool.true_and]

end Representation.HigmanSims.LargeModels.Restricted1408.Density.Cyclicity.ColumnRecurrences
